 "phrases": [
  {
   "text": "Every morning, this prisoner pours honey all over his shoulders.",
   "s": 0.0,
   "e": 2.441
  },
  {
   "text": "The guards beg him to stop.",
   "s": 2.589,
   "e": 3.833
  },
  {
   "text": "The whole cell gets sticky,",
   "s": 4.181,
   "e": 5.73
  },
  {
   "text": "and he just smiles.",
   "s": 6.096,
   "e": 7.395
  },
  {
   "text": "Then he kneels and waits,",
   "s": 7.721,
   "e": 8.836
  },
  {
   "text": "perfectly still,",
   "s": 9.307,
   "e": 10.938
  },
  {
   "text": "while every fly in the castle shows up for breakfast.",
   "s": 11.287,
   "e": 15.149
  },
  {
   "text": "\"Why your shoulders?\"",
   "s": 15.742,
   "e": 17.099
  },
  {
   "text": "a guard moans.",
   "s": 17.272,
   "e": 18.128
  },
  {
   "text": "A fly walks right across his nose.",
   "s": 18.576,
   "e": 20.675
  },
  {
   "text": "He doesn't even blink.",
   "s": 21.118,
   "e": 22.09
  },
  {
   "text": "That's it.",
   "s": 22.687,
   "e": 23.229
  },
  {
   "text": "The captain rips the honey jar out of his hands and storms off with it.",
   "s": 23.538,
   "e": 26.871
  },
  {
   "text": "But the flies follow the honey.",
   "s": 27.314,
   "e": 28.791
  },
  {
   "text": "Up the stairs, down the hall, and straight into the royal feast.",
   "s": 29.163,
   "e": 32.871
  },
  {
   "text": "Into the king's soup.",
   "s": 33.203,
   "e": 34.296
  },
  {
   "text": "Into the queen's hair.",
   "s": 34.627,
   "e": 35.811
  },
  {
   "text": "And the king hates flies more than anything.",
   "s": 36.252,
   "e": 38.702
  },
  {
   "text": "He swings his sword so wildly he chops his own dinner in half.",
   "s": 39.041,
   "e": 42.695
  },
  {
   "text": "\"Who brought these flies?\"",
   "s": 43.05,
   "e": 44.481
  },
  {
   "text": "he roars.",
   "s": 44.639,
   "e": 45.255
  },
  {
   "text": "Everyone points down,",
   "s": 45.631,
   "e": 46.788
  },
  {
   "text": "through the grate in the floor,",
   "s": 47.034,
   "e": 48.237
  },
  {
   "text": "at the prisoner.",
   "s": 48.576,
   "e": 49.209
  },
  {
   "text": "The king storms into the dungeon, and everyone is sure that man is about to lose his head.",
   "s": 49.658,
   "e": 54.358
  },
  {
   "text": "The prisoner kneels.",
   "s": 54.83,
   "e": 55.834
  },
  {
   "text": "One fat fly on each shoulder.",
   "s": 56.196,
   "e": 58.234
  },
  {
   "text": "Smack,",
   "s": 58.642,
   "e": 59.126
  },
  {
   "text": "left.",
   "s": 59.36,
   "e": 59.706
  },
  {
   "text": "Smack, right.",
   "s": 59.99,
   "e": 60.523
  },
  {
   "text": "\"Thank you,",
   "s": 60.756,
   "e": 61.116
  },
  {
   "text": "Your Majesty.\"",
   "s": 61.68,
   "e": 62.88
  },
  {
   "text": "You see,",
   "s": 63.532,
   "e": 63.939
  },
  {
   "text": "when a king touches a man on both shoulders with his sword,",
   "s": 64.157,
   "e": 67.046
  },
  {
   "text": "that man becomes a knight.",
   "s": 67.306,
   "e": 68.675
  },
  {
   "text": "And nobody keeps a knight in chains.",
   "s": 69.109,
   "e": 71.149
  }
 ]
